In Romansh, to say that someone likes doing something, you have to use the word "Gugent"
^^Positive statements^^
In positive statements, put "Gugent" *after the verb*

^^Negative statements^^
In negative statements, put "Gugent" *after the word "betg"*

^^Questions^^
In questions, put "Gugent" *after the verb of the question*

The object in all of these sentences comes *after "gugent"*